                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 1,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.1 Remarks on the accompanying documentation (none, or give comments): NONE",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 2,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.2. Remarks for visual, measurement and other inspections including Materials completeness (none, or give comments):1. The inconsistency of the delivered products with the Technical Assignment (Annex 1) was revealed during the incoming inspection: there was a discrepancy in the overall dimensions, according to the Technical Assignment the diameter of the lid is not less than 830 mm, in fact it is 730 mm. / При проведении входного контроля было выявлено несоответствие поставленной продукции Техническому заданию (Приложение 1): выявлено несоответствие габаритных размеров, по Техническому заданию диаметр крышки не менее 830 мм, по факту 730 мм.2. Subsection 1.2 (Information on novelty) of the Technical Assignment was violated - the product was manufactured in 2023. / Нарушен подраздел 1.2 (Сведения о новизне) Технического задания - продукция произведена в 2023 году.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 3,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.3. Remarks for preservation and/or anticorrosive coating (none, or give comments): NONE",
                    "gridspan": 5,
